{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:06:45.059Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e7df45df032be314ae33f1769df9007c452cfbc84dc3674b6c4815fda83e12d0","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"@Bettina Kroll: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 2025-11-02 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03\". So the handover date is **Monday, November 3, 2025**.\n\nThe digest says \"account ownership changes hands\" and doesn't name Kwame. I'm assuming the new owner is Kwame, which fits the Coastal roster. The digest is also a plan written the day before, not a confirmation that it happened. If the tracker needs the official date, you may want to check it with Kwame.\n\nDon't use the \"PHL\" shorthand without checking. Moss's cheat sheet notes that Covey & Lark Retail (now Pellow Home Living) also goes by PHL. The Saltmarsh handoff in the October 2025 digest is a different account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
